Train a model on the #pusht dataset and visualize it in Rerun!
@LeRobotHF is a project by @huggingface that aims to provide models, datasets and tools for real-world robotics in @PyTorch. This example shows how one can train a model on the push-dataset and visualize its progress in rerun.
